Bundled skill recommendations
============================

Add recommended skills here as either:

  <name>/SKILL.md

or a flat:

  <name>.md

Each file needs YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description`. The **Web**
image copies this directory to `/opt/dsh-seed/skills`; Tavern does not copy it
and has no seed skills. On first seed or explicit state migration, missing
bundles are copied into `$DSH_HOME/skills`; users may edit or delete them. They
are not scanned from `/opt`, are not part of the mandatory auth boundary, and
are not restored on every restart.

`rtk/SKILL.md` is maintained in this repository. The `caveman` skill is fetched
at image-build time from the latest `JuliusBrussee/caveman` GitHub release tag
(not the moving `main` branch); its `SOURCE`, `LICENSE` and `NOTICE` files are
included in the seed. These optional assets are
not version-pinned or tracked by Renovate. The image digest is the
reproducibility boundary.

Do not put README.md here: the provider treats top-level `.md` files as flat
skill candidates and rejects them for missing frontmatter. This README has no
`.md` extension for that reason.
